# The layout service's numbers at every size (task 014 P1b), as text for the Controller:
# out/<WxH>/metrics.txt = screen class, density and its source, tokens, text sizes, compat window and
# toolbar, the home-grid layout in use, the APPLAUNCH_SCREEN_* environment and screen.state.
# No picture: nothing here is compared with the goldens.
# 480x640 and 480x800: the PDA profile (report 038 S2, pi3a-wsdsi43-portrait), with the turned app's environment.
title metrics
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 720x720 1280x720 1024x600 480x640 480x800
@480x640,480x800 profile pda
metrics metrics
